  "description": "Our mission is simple; to create events for the benefit of the furry community that promote connection, compassion and creativity. We aim to host events that celebrate the fandom, both in Victoria and abroad, and we’re proud to support charitable causes to give back to our wider community. \r\n\r\nWe continue to strive to make MFC the perfect space to celebrate the best of what the furry community has to offer. Join us as we create this wonderful event – one paw, claw, and step at a time!",
